  "prefLabel": "En 402.20 Telecommunications relay service (TRS)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 402.20 “Telecommunications relay service (TRS)” means a service that enables telephone communication between hearing people and people who are deaf, hard of hearing, or speech impaired.\n\nSource. #14015, eff 7-1-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 400)",
